message: "If you use this code, please cite the accompanying manuscript and the archived release of this repository."
title: "psoriasis-cd207-langerhans-reanalysis: analysis code for a transparency-focused two-group single-cell re-analysis of the CD207+ Langerhans/DC compartment in psoriasis"
abstract: >-
  Analysis code for a pre-specified, donor-level re-analysis of public psoriasis
  skin transcriptomes. The pipeline harmonises gene identifiers, performs cell-level
  QC and doublet removal, integrates with Harmony, annotates lineages and re-clusters
  the myeloid/DC compartment; tests a frozen one-sided Jonckheere-Terpstra ordered
  trend with Benjamini-Hochberg correction on donor-level pseudo-samples; runs
  two-group pseudobulk differential expression, GO/Hallmark enrichment and GSVA;
  and validates a single-gene CD207 readout in three independent bulk cohorts.
  It also contains the post hoc supplementary layer (composition controls and an
  empirical null, maturation axis, transcription-factor activity) and renders
  Figures 1-4 and Supplementary Figures S1-S6.
type: software
